{"track":"python","category":"함수·클래스","level":3,"title":"안전한 정수 변환","desc":"<p>문자열 <code>s</code>를 정수로 바꿔 돌려주되, 정수로 바꿀 수 없으면 <code>None</code>을 돌려주는 <code>parse_int(s)</code>를 만드세요. 앞뒤 공백은 있어도 돼요.</p>","starter":"def parse_int(s):\n    pass\n","solution":"def parse_int(s):\n    try:\n        return int(s)\n    except ValueError:\n        return None\n","hint":"<p>바꿀 수 없는 문자열에 <code>int()</code>를 쓰면 <code>ValueError</code>가 나요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"parse_int(\"12\")","expected":12,"visible":true},{"call":"parse_int(\"x\")","expected":null,"visible":true},{"call":"parse_int(\"-5\")","expected":-5,"visible":false},{"call":"parse_int(\" 7 \")","expected":7,"visible":false},{"call":"parse_int(\"3.5\")","expected":null,"visible":false},{"call":"parse_int(\"\")","expected":null,"visible":false}],"id":"py-085"}